{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/extras/8b40656dc3752d8bddb6b1d246e2d28c.poster.avif?t=1759688198\" width=1400 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/extras/8b40656dc3752d8bddb6b1d246e2d28c.webm?t=1759688198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Barrel Roll is a turn-based roguelike deckbuilder. The deck ? A six slot revolver barrel.</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/extras/452228c97633f0b1a24af8e65e45e431.avif?t=1759688198\" width=1200 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/extras/40f7ed10b5ac8e689bb8f40f51a5c67b.poster.avif?t=1759688198\" width=780 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/extras/40f7ed10b5ac8e689bb8f40f51a5c67b.webm?t=1759688198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take down hordes of outlaws</strong> to get to their leaders. <strong>Collect bullets</strong> with special effects, <strong>trinkets\u00a0</strong>and <strong>ressources</strong>. Each of your bullets has its <strong>archetype</strong> (Damage, Shield, Initiative, Focus and Killer). It's up to you to <strong>customize your ideal barrel</strong> et <strong>create powerful synergies</strong> to counter your enemies !\u00a0   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/extras/f0e4ced1f3c100cfcf0b63fb52b40ea3.avif?t=1759688198\" width=1200 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/extras/60382475fbe594cf9e5d8e52a1cf1a7e.poster.avif?t=1759688198\" width=780 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/extras/60382475fbe594cf9e5d8e52a1cf1a7e.webm?t=1759688198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face groups of 3 to 5 bandits in <strong>turn based combats</strong>. After each of your shots, <strong>choose your next bullet between the 3 next</strong> and come up with mind blowing combos ! (Litterally...)<br>Crush your opponents (at least their shield) to <strong>delay their next turn</strong> and use one of your <strong>3 skills</strong> to show your mastery and turn the duel upside down.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/extras/f39f1486360d99d8acc9e519dd722e0b.avif?t=1759688198\" width=1200 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/extras/9a6c05b481d365e2468463d4d4d45732.poster.avif?t=1759688198\" width=780 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/extras/9a6c05b481d365e2468463d4d4d45732.webm?t=1759688198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your next destination</strong> carefully to gain options for your next fights ! <br>Some resources you\u2019ll find on the road could be super useful at the saloon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>It\u2019s up to you to write your own legend by building your perfect barrel.</strong></i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>In Barrel Roll you'll find...</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >64 <u><strong>bullets</strong></u> with powerful effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 <u><strong>trinkets</strong></u> to change the way you play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 <strong><u>skills</u></strong> to get out of every situation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 <u><strong>bosses</strong></u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 5 <u><strong>Threat level</strong></u> to make sure you won't stand a chance to beat BARREL ROLL </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3860590?t=1759688198","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/46369465ba8361646af23d70b0913837635cff1f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759688198","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/76bec26c49a6ac3fdcadbc4b33ef6d77461b601a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759688198","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3860590/76bec26c49a6ac3fdcadbc4b33ef6d77461b601a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759688198","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3941140,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop pl